Begin3
Title:                 SBMix
Description:           display and change SoundBlaster Pro (and compatibles) mixer settings
Summary:               SBMIX is a tiny program to display and change SoundBlaster Pro (and compatibles) mixer settings, i.e., Master, Wave, FM, CD, Line and Mic volumes, directly from DOS command line. It may be required with some cards to hear anything under plain DOS, as some cards are initialized with zero volume.
Keywords:              dos, sound blaster, audio, volume
End
